Combine MM-estimation with bootstrapped (one- or two-way clustered) standard errors.
----------------------

 ^roboot^
 
Description
-----------

^roboot^ Combine MM-estimation with bootstrapped (one- or two-way clustered) standard errors.
     
^Note:^ Requires roboot.ado by Olah Data Semarang

Examples
--------

 . ^roboot roboot roboot_1 roboot_2 roboot_3, eff(95) cluster(Id Year) nboot(1000)^

Author
